# Backends

Three families, one set of `i_*.hpp` interfaces. `manager` = SDK-free thread dispatch. `loader` = plugin-only bring-up. `downloader` = HF model fetch (local only).

| Mode | STT | LM | TTS | Notes |
|------|-----|----|-----|-------|
| local | whisper.cpp | llama.cpp | Piper | arm64 + Win; gated `XPWELLYS_USE_LOCAL_INFERENCE` |
| openai | Whisper API | gpt-4o-mini JSON | TTS API | Keychain `...openai` |
| mistral | Voxtral STT | mistral-small JSON | Voxtral TTS | Keychain `...mistral`; TTS returns JSON+base64 WAV |

- LM only when intent confidence < 0.7
- x86_64: no local symbols; loader remaps `local` → `openai`
- Mistral German speech: no DE preset voice (Issue #63); clean DE = Local/Piper
- Never put API keys in settings; truncate keys in logs to last 4 chars
